WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:01.201
A video you haven't seen before.

00:00:01.201 --> 00:00:03.169
Pictures of a hero taking mass murderers

00:00:03.169 --> 00:00:03.870
