00:00:03.870 --> 00:00:05.505
Confronting, grappling with him

00:00:05.505 --> 00:00:06.039
and disarming

00:00:06.039 --> 00:00:07.574
someone who had just moments before

00:00:07.574 --> 00:00:08.775
shot and fatally wounded.

00:00:08.775 --> 00:00:10.910
11 people at another location

00:00:10.910 --> 00:00:12.779
and was about to do the same again

00:00:12.779 --> 00:00:14.180
Saturday night at a ballroom

00:00:14.180 --> 00:00:15.148
and dance studio

00:00:15.148 --> 00:00:16.449
in Alhambra, California,

00:00:16.449 --> 00:00:18.151
just outside Los Angeles.

00:00:18.151 --> 00:00:20.220
Brandon Tsay and his family run

00:00:20.620 --> 00:00:22.422
the video is slowed down somewhat.

00:00:22.422 --> 00:00:24.090
