00:00:24.090 --> 00:00:24.991
old mass killer

00:00:24.991 --> 00:00:26.760
who had already carried out a mass

00:00:26.760 --> 00:00:28.928
shooting at another ballroom

00:00:28.928 --> 00:00:30.997
