00:00:35.435 --> 00:00:37.070
ten semiautomatic

00:00:37.070 --> 00:00:39.005
with what appears to be a suppressor

00:00:39.005 --> 00:00:39.873
or a silencer.

00:00:39.873 --> 00:00:41.041
Which authorities say he'd

00:00:41.041 --> 00:00:42.809
