00:00:42.809 --> 00:00:44.411
Brandon Tsay tells us he

00:00:44.411 --> 00:00:46.579
heard sounds metal on metal noises.

00:00:46.579 --> 00:00:48.181
And you can see the shooter

00:00:48.181 --> 00:00:50.216
