00:00:54.054 --> 00:00:56.222
as if to look around, at which point.

00:00:56.256 --> 00:00:57.824
Seconds later, you see Brandon,

00:00:57.824 --> 00:00:59.893
they're entering and confronting the man,

00:00:59.926 --> 00:01:01.361
his arms outstretched,

00:01:01.361 --> 00:01:03.530
reaching for the man and then the weapon.

00:01:03.530 --> 00:01:05.331
The struggle then moves into the doorway

00:01:05.331 --> 00:01:07.200
and just outside that room.

00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:08.034
We're just seeing this

00:01:08.034 --> 00:01:08.935
