00:01:08.935 --> 00:01:10.670
You've never seen this video before.

00:01:10.670 --> 00:01:12.272
Brandon will describe in a moment

00:01:12.272 --> 00:01:13.673
just what was happening,

00:01:13.673 --> 00:01:14.541
what he was doing

00:01:14.541 --> 00:01:16.443
and thinking in the seconds that we see

00:01:16.443 --> 00:01:17.877
and what we don't see.

00:01:17.877 --> 00:01:20.180
Again, the killer has a Mac Ten,

00:01:20.180 --> 00:01:21.815
apparently a suppressor in stock.

00:01:21.815 --> 00:01:23.750
He'd already killed ten people.

00:01:23.750 --> 00:01:25.318
An 11th victim died today

00:01:25.318 --> 00:01:27.520
and he might have taken many more lives.

00:01:27.520 --> 00:01:29.456
Had the scene we're watching played out.

00:01:29.456 --> 00:01:30.890
Otherwise, had Brandon

00:01:30.890 --> 00:01:32.358
not gotten the gun

00:01:32.358 --> 00:01:32.792
and driven

00:01:32.792 --> 00:01:33.793
the gunman who later took

00:01:33.793 --> 00:01:34.928
